      "expected_mock_intent": "agree", "kev_needed": false,
      "score_override": {"agree": 0.975, "reject": 0.01, "takeover": 0.015},
      "notes": "规范 §6.1 场景1。明确肯定短句；真实 KEV~0.975，正差与绝对分(>0.75)均达标。"
