      "user_reply": "嗯", "expected_kev_intent": "agree", "expected_action": "execute",
      "expected_mock_intent": null, "kev_needed": true,
      "score_override": {"agree": 0.977, "reject": 0.005, "takeover": 0.018},
      "notes": "规范 §5.2 单字肯定；真实 KEV~0.977 判 agree。mock 无响亮关键词落 unknown，mock 不足以验收；须真实 KEV 正控断言——防止含糊护栏把单字肯定误伤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "agree-07", "category": "agree", "first_tool": "energy_stop_charging",
      "user_reply": "嗯，好", "expected_kev_intent": "agree", "expected_action": "execute",
      "expected_mock_intent": "agree", "kev_needed": false,
      "score_override": {"agree": 0.90, "reject": 0.03, "takeover": 0.07},
      "notes": "叹词开头+肯定尾，明确同意停止充电。"
