    {
      "id": "edge-negation-01", "category": "edge", "first_tool": "car_drive_ESPSwitch",
      "user_reply": "不是，我说的是关掉它", "expected_kev_intent": "agree", "expected_action": "execute",
      "expected_mock_intent": null, "kev_needed": true,
      "score_override": {"agree": 0.82, "reject": 0.10, "takeover": 0.08},
      "notes": "易错：句首'不是'是否定助词(纠正)，真正意图是重申'关掉它'(对'关闭ESP'=agree)。mock 把'不是'+'关掉'当 reject——语义误判。真实 KEV 需靠 confirm_ask 上下文区分'否定句首纠正'与'否定整个请求'。mock 最典型失败模式，须隧道验收。"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-negation-02", "category": "edge", "first_tool": "car_drive_ESPSwitch",
