      "expected_mock_intent": "reject", "kev_needed": true,
      "score_override": {"agree": 0.84, "reject": 0.09, "takeover": 0.07},
      "notes": "双重否定'不是别关' -> 实为强调同意'要关'。mock 因'别关'/'不是'判 reject。真实 KEV 须解析后半句'要关'为 agree。"
