      "score_override": {"agree": 0.10, "reject": 0.78, "takeover": 0.12},
      "notes": "'先不弄了'=暂缓/放弃；对制动保养高危动作应弃。mock 落 unknown(无不清晰关键词组合)，语义上应 reject，须真实 KEV 确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-politeness-01", "category": "edge", "first_tool": "energy_unlock_charge_cable",
